<title>USA: Klamath First Bancorp completes buyback.</title>
<headline>Klamath First Bancorp completes buyback.</headline>
<dateline>KLAMATH FALLS, Ore. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Klamath First Bancorp Inc said it completed its stock repurchase program, buying back five percent, or 611,655 shares, of common stock.</p>
<p>The repurchase program was completed at an average price of $14.327 per share, Klamath said.</p>
<p>The company said it now has 11,612,470 shares of common stock issued and outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk  (212) 859-1610</p>
</text>
